el Clijdesdale, Eddy Henning, Nikolaus Maximilian Linaric, Dr. Ralph Müller, Nurten Spitzer-Erdogan · Sitz: Frankfurt am Main · AG Frankfurt am Main HRB 7727\\n0340\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nSteuernummer: 014 220 2800 4 · USt-IdNr.: DE 114 103 475 · Internet: www.ing.de · BIC: INGDDEFFXXX · Mitglied im Einlagensicherungsfonds"], "created": ["None", "2026-04-14 00:00:00+00:00"], "checksum": ["None", "4df4bd99ea4be2bbf143fff41f1090cc"], "mime_type": ["None", "application/pdf"], "deleted_at": ["None", "None"], "page_count": ["None", "1"], "restored_at": ["None", "None"], "share_links": ["None", "documents.ShareLink.None"], "storage_path": ["None", "None"], "storage_type": ["None", "unencrypted"], "correspondent": ["None", "None"], "custom_fields": ["None", "documents.CustomFieldInstance.None"], "document_type": ["None", "None"], "workflow_runs": ["None", "documents.WorkflowRun.None"], "original_filename": ["None", "Persoenliche_Nachricht_20260414.pdf"]}	2026-05-20 15:59:52.769135+00	\N	14	\N	\N	\N	\N		\N	\N
