1482	191	191	2026-02-25T00:00:00+00:00 71767448557969	0	{"id": ["None", "191"], "added": ["None", "2026-05-20 16:02:10.142447"], "notes": ["None", "documents.Note.None"], "owner": ["None", "None"], "title": ["None", "71767448557969"], "content": ["None", "Boarding Pass\\n\\nGate Seat\\nVERHUELSDONK LARISSA MS\\nBooking Ref: ZLSDSF 57K\\nBoarding Time\\n\\n12:55\\n25 FEB ETKT 2172979269629\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nDepart Arrive Flight Class\\n\\n13:35 06:10 TG 925 Economy\\n\\nMUNICH BANGKOK\\n25 Feb 2026 10h 35min 26 Feb 2026 Group Sequence\\n\\nMUNICH BANGKOK 2 45\\nINTERNATIONAL SUVARNABHUMI INTL\\nTerminal 2 Terminal\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nCheck-in counter close 60 min. before departure. Boarding gates close 15 min. before departure.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nInformation before you fly\\nThis boarding pass is valid for the specified fight, date, time and passenger's name only.\\nTHAI reserve the right to refuse passenger(s) with improper travel documents.\\nReservations are subject to cancellation if you are not on board the aircraft at least 20 minutes prior to departure\\n\\n\\n\\nArriving at the Airport\\nPlease report to THAI Internet Check-in Counter at least 60 minutes prior to scheduled departure time for international fight\\nor at least 45 minutes prior to scheduled departure time for domestic fight with the following items:\\nHome Print Boarding Pass, in full A4 size at every checkpoint for security purpose.\\nTravel Documents e.g. Passport, ID card, Visa and health Certificates (if applicable).\\nCredit/Debit card used to purchase the flights e-ticket (if applicable).\\nCheck-in baggage to drop off.\\n\\n\\nMunich Airport:\\n• Please contact Internet Check-in Counter to verify documents and drop off your baggage.\\nDangerous Goods not Permitted in Passenger Baggage\\nThese hazardous materials are considered dangerous and cannot be taken on board.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nDangerous and prohibited goods may not be carried in passenger baggage for security reasons. Further information on\\nrequest.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nOnly allowed items\\nOnly allowed In carry-on baggage and passenger cabin\\nOnly allowed on one’s person\\n\\nSpare batteries / power E-cigarettes Heat producing articles 1 small lighter or 1 box\\n\\nbanks of matches\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nProhibited Items\\nProhibited in checked baggage and carry-on baggage\\n\\n\\nExplosives Oxygen cylinders Gasoline / fuel paste Camping gas\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nOxidizing /corrosive Tasers Paint / alcohol > 70% Poison / household\\n\\nsubstances chemicals\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nRadioactive material Battery powered\\n\\ntransportation devices\\n\\n\\n\\nProhibited in carry-on baggage\\n\\n\\nFrames / ammunition Sharp / pointed objects Blunt Instruments Workmen’s tools\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPlease confirm that NO Replacement batteries or power banks are in your checked baggage."], "created": ["None", "2026-02-25 00:00:00+00:00"], "checksum": ["None", "a0cad9cda55067671c980a493a0fa11b"], "mime_type": ["None", "application/pdf"], "deleted_at": ["None", "None"], "page_count": ["None", "2"], "restored_at": ["None", "None"], "share_links": ["None", "documents.ShareLink.None"], "storage_path": ["None", "None"], "storage_type": ["None", "unencrypted"], "correspondent": ["None", "None"], "custom_fields": ["None", "documents.CustomFieldInstance.None"], "document_type": ["None", "None"], "workflow_runs": ["None", "documents.WorkflowRun.None"], "original_filename": ["None", "71767448557969.pdf"]}	2026-05-20 16:02:10.147085+00	\N	14	\N	\N	\N	\N		\N	\N
