1485	192	192	2025-09-22T00:00:00+00:00 Adam_K__ndigungsempfehlung	0	{"id": ["None", "192"], "added": ["None", "2026-05-20 16:02:41.203571"], "notes": ["None", "documents.Note.None"], "owner": ["None", "None"], "title": ["None", "Adam_K__ndigungsempfehlung"], "content": ["None", "Robert ADAM\\nFacharzt fir Allgemeinmedizin\\nBrodkorbweg 35:87437 Kempten\\n\\n@ 0831/73382 - Fax 0831/72739\\n\\nRobert ADAM -Facharzt fiir Allgemeinmedizin:-Brodkorbweg 46:87437 Kempten 22.09.2025\\n\\nZur Vorlage beim Arbeitsamt\\n\\nFrau Larissa Mika Verhiilsdonk, 07.03.1989, wohnhaft: 87437 Kempten, Am Augarten 13, befindet\\nsich in meiner Behandlung. Ich habe Frau Verhillsdonk den arztlichen Rat erteilt ihre bisherige Stelle\\naus gesundheitlichen Gruinden zu kindigen.\\n\\nUf Allgemeinmedizin\\n#46 - 87437 Kempten\\n\\ni\\nRobert Adam\\nFacharzt fur Allgemeinmedizin"], "created": ["None", "2025-09-22 00:00:00+00:00"], "checksum": ["None", "99cc1570a9edda1ed9eeabc93c374832"], "mime_type": ["None", "application/pdf"], "deleted_at": ["None", "None"], "page_count": ["None", "1"], "restored_at": ["None", "None"], "share_links": ["None", "documents.ShareLink.None"], "storage_path": ["None", "None"], "storage_type": ["None", "unencrypted"], "correspondent": ["None", "None"], "custom_fields": ["None", "documents.CustomFieldInstance.None"], "document_type": ["None", "None"], "workflow_runs": ["None", "documents.WorkflowRun.None"], "original_filename": ["None", "Adam_K__ndigungsempfehlung.pdf"]}	2026-05-20 16:02:41.20985+00	\N	14	\N	\N	\N	\N		\N	\N
