1706	221	221	2026-02-01T00:00:00+00:00 Gmail - [JsVisados] Asunto_ [TDACTH.COM] Reason_ Refund - Contact Form	0	{"id": ["None", "221"], "added": ["None", "2026-05-22 06:10:28.857345"], "notes": ["None", "documents.Note.None"], "owner": ["None", "None"], "title": ["None", "Gmail - [JsVisados] Asunto_ [TDACTH.COM] Reason_ Refund - Contact Form"], "content": ["None", "Gmail - [JsVisados] Asunto: [TDACTH.COM] Reason: Refund - Conta... https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?ik=5a334ad834&view=pt&search=a...\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nLarissa Verhülsdonk <larissagodzilla@gmail.com>\\n\\n\\n\\n[JsVisados] Asunto: [TDACTH.COM] Reason: Refund - Contact Form\\n3 Nachrichten\\n\\nSupport TravelGroupJs (JsVisados) <support@jsvisados.zendesk.com> 8. Mai 2026 um 13:46\\nAntwort an: JsVisados <support+idRYDXXE-7PDMR@jsvisados.zendesk.com>\\nAn: VERHUELSDONK LARISSA <larissagodzilla@gmail.com>\\n\\nWe understand your concerns and truly want to find a fair solution.\\n\\n\\nAs a final resolution, we are able to offer a 40% refund, which is the maximum refund we are authorized to\\nprovide while maintaining the service.\\n\\n\\nPlease let us know if you would like to proceed with this option.\\n\\n\\nBest regards,\\n\\n\\nSupport Team\\n\\n\\n\\nJsVisados\\njssvisa.com\\n\\n\\n\\nEste correo electrónico es un servicio de JsVisados. Entregado por Zendesk\\n\\n\\nEl 7 de mayo de 2026, 17:56:13 UTC, VERHUELSDONK LARISSA larissagodzilla@gmail.com escribió:\\n\\nSource: tdacth.com\\n\\nGood day,\\n\\nI hereby revoke any and all authorizations, subscriptions, recurring payments, and consent previously given to your\\ncompany.\\n\\nI demand the immediate cancellation of any active subscription or recurring billing connected to my personal data\\nand payment information.\\n\\nFurthermore, I request a full refund of all unauthorized charges that were deducted after the initial payment on 27.\\nFebruary 2026.\\n\\nAny further attempt to charge my account will be considered unauthorized and may be reported to the relevant\\nconsumer protection authorities, payment providers, and law enforcement agencies.\\n\\nPlease confirm in writing that:\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n1 of 3 5/22/2026, 8:09 AM\\nGmail - [JsVisados] Asunto: [TDACTH.COM] Reason: Refund - Conta... https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?ik=5a334ad834&view=pt&search=a...\\n\\n\\n1. All subscriptions and recurring payments have been cancelled,\\n2. My personal and payment data has been deleted,\\n3. All unauthorized charges will be refunded.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nLarissa Verhülsdonk\\n\\n[RYDXXE-7PDMR]\\n\\n\\nLarissa Verhülsdonk <larissagodzilla@gmail.com> 11. Mai 2026 um 18:19\\nAn: JsVisados <support+idRYDXXE-7PDMR@jsvisados.zendesk.com>\\nCc: Antanina Verhülsdonk <choconinanut@gmail.com>\\n\\n\\nGood day,\\n\\nYour response does not address the core issue of my complaint.\\n\\nI explicitly dispute that I ever authorized any subscription, recurring billing agreement, or ongoing service relationship\\nwith your company.\\n\\nBefore discussing any refund percentage, I request that you provide the following information and evidence:\\n\\n�. A precise description of the product or service that I supposedly purchased after the initial one-time payment\\nfor the Thailand Digital Arrival Card.\\n2. The exact date, time, IP address, and technical records of the alleged consent regarding recurring payments.\\n3. A copy or screenshot of the checkout page, terms, and consent flow that allegedly authorized recurring monthly\\ncharges.\\n4. The legal and contractual basis for charging replacement payment cards after the original card had already\\nbeen blocked.\\n5. Confirmation whether Visa Account Updater, network tokenization, or similar payment update services were\\nused to continue charging my account.\\n\\nAdditionally, I again demand:\\n\\n• immediate cancellation of all recurring charges,\\n• deletion of all stored payment credentials and tokens related to both the original and replacement card,\\n• deletion of my personal data unless retention is legally required,\\n• written confirmation once this has been completed.\\n\\nAt present, I have not received evidence that any recurring payment authorization ever existed.\\n\\nRegards,\\n\\nLarissa Verhülsdonk\\n\\n[Zitierter Text ausgeblendet]\\n\\n\\n\\nSupport TravelGroupJs (JsVisados) <support@jsvisados.zendesk.com> 21. Mai 2026 um 15:22\\nAntwort an: JsVisados <support+idRYDXXE-7PDMR@jsvisados.zendesk.com>\\nAn: VERHUELSDONK LARISSA <larissagodzilla@gmail.com>\\nCc: Antanina Verhülsdonk <choconinanut@gmail.com>\\n\\nWe have already processed the cancellation and the refund in the case that the membership fee was\\ncharged. Thank you.\\n\\n\\n\\nJsVisados\\n\\n\\n\\n2 of 3 5/22/2026, 8:09 AM\\nGmail - [JsVisados] Asunto: [TDACTH.COM] Reason: Refund - Conta... https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?ik=5a334ad834&view=pt&search=a...\\n\\n\\njssvisa.com\\n\\n\\n\\nEste correo electrónico es un servicio de JsVisados. Entregado por Zendesk\\n\\n\\nEl 11 de mayo de 2026, 16:19:17 UTC, VERHUELSDONK LARISSA larissagodzilla@gmail.com escribió:\\n\\nGood day,\\n\\nYour response does not address the core issue of my complaint.\\n\\nI explicitly dispute that I ever authorized any subscription, recurring billing agreement, or ongoing service\\nrelationship with your company.\\n\\nBefore discussing any refund percentage, I request that you provide the following information and evidence:\\n\\n�. A precise description of the product or service that I supposedly purchased after the initial one-time payment\\nfor the Thailand Digital Arrival Card.\\n2. The exact date, time, IP address, and technical records of the alleged consent regarding recurring payments.\\n3. A copy or screenshot of the checkout page, terms, and consent flow that allegedly authorized recurring\\nmonthly charges.\\n4. The legal and contractual basis for charging replacement payment cards after the original card had already\\nbeen blocked.\\n5. Confirmation whether Visa Account Updater, network toke